error[math/unsupported]: found "\label", which may only appear in a numbered equation environment
  --> kaorubb-hoff/ch2--2-6.org:40:1
   |
40 | \label{2.6ans2}
   | ^^^^^^ cannot be used here
   |
   = help: only `equation`, `align`, `gather` and `multline` are numbered, and so take a `\label`; `$$…$$` and `\[…\]` aren't
   = note: run `yuanme docs math/unsupported` for more
error[math/unsupported]: unmatched closing token: "\end{...}"
  --> kaorubb-hoff/ch2--2-6.org:49:1
   |
49 | \end{equation}
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ no matching opening for this
   |
   = note: run `yuanme docs math/unsupported` for more
<h2 id="answer">Answer</h2>
<p><math><mi>A</mi><mo>⟂</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi></math> means that</p>
<math display="block"><mtable displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0" style="width: 100%"><mtr><mtd style="width: 50%"></mtd><mtd><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mtd><mtd style="width: 50%;text-align: right;justify-items: end;" id="2.6condition"><mtext>(1)</mtext></mtd></mtr></mtable></math>
<p>holds.</p>
<math display="block"><mtable displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0" style="width: 100%"><mtr><mtd style="width: 50%"></mtd><mtd><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mtd><mtd style="width: 50%;text-align: right;justify-items: end;" id="2.6condition2"><mtext>(2)</mtext></mtd></mtr></mtable></math>
<p>From this equation, we can rewrite <math><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></math> as follows.</p>
<math display="block"><mtable displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0" style="width: 100%"><mtr><mtd style="width: 50%"></mtd><mtd><mtable displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0"><mtr><mtd style="text-align: right;justify-items: end;padding-right: 0;"><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mtd><mtd style="text-align: left;justify-items: start;padding-left: 0;"><mo>=</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mspace width="2em"/><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0" rspace="0.2778em">∵</mo><mtext><a href="#2.6condition2">(2)</a></mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd style="text-align: right;justify-items: end;padding-right: 0;"></mtd><mtd style="text-align: left;justify-items: start;padding-left: 0;"><mo>=</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mspace width="2em"/><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0" rspace="0.2778em">∵</mo><mtext><a href="#2.6condition">(1)</a></mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd style="text-align: right;justify-items: end;padding-right: 0;"></mtd><mtd style="text-align: left;justify-items: start;padding-left: 0;"><mo>=</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mrow><mo lspace="0.1667em">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd style="text-align: right;justify-items: end;padding-right: 0;"></mtd><mtd style="text-align: left;justify-items: start;padding-left: 0;"><mo>=</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd style="text-align: right;justify-items: end;padding-right: 0;"></mtd></mtr></mtable></mtd><mtd style="width: 50%;text-align: right;justify-items: end;" id="2.6ans1"><mtext>(3)</mtext></mtd></mtr></mtable></math>
<p>This means <math><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo>⟂</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi></math>.</p>
<p>Similarly, <math><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></math> can be rewritten as follows.

</p>
<math display="block"><mtable displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0"><mtr><mtd style="text-align: right;justify-items: end;padding-right: 0;"><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mtd><mtd style="text-align: left;justify-items: start;padding-left: 0;"><mo>=</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd style="text-align: right;justify-items: end;padding-right: 0;"></mtd><mtd style="text-align: left;justify-items: start;padding-left: 0;"><mo>=</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mspace width="2em"/><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0" rspace="0.2778em">∵</mo><mtext><a href="#2.6condition">(1)</a></mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd style="text-align: right;justify-items: end;padding-right: 0;"></mtd><mtd style="text-align: left;justify-items: start;padding-left: 0;"><mo>=</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mrow><mo lspace="0.1667em">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd style="text-align: right;justify-items: end;padding-right: 0;"></mtd><mtd style="text-align: left;justify-items: start;padding-left: 0;"><mo>=</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd style="text-align: right;justify-items: end;padding-right: 0;"></mtd></mtr></mtable></math>
<p>
This means <math><mi>A</mi><mo>⟂</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi></math>.</p>
<p>Furthermore, <math><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo>∩</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></math> can also be calculated in the same way.</p>
<math display="block"><mtable displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0" style="width: 100%"><mtr><mtd style="width: 50%"></mtd><mtd style="text-align: right;justify-items: end;padding-right: 0;"><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo>∩</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mtd><mtd style="text-align: left;justify-items: start;padding-left: 0;"><mo>=</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mtd><mtd style="width: 50%"></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd style="width: 50%"></mtd><mtd style="text-align: right;justify-items: end;padding-right: 0;"></mtd><mtd style="text-align: left;justify-items: start;padding-left: 0;"><mo>=</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mspace width="2em"/><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0" rspace="0.2778em">∵</mo><mtext><a href="#2.6ans1">(3)</a></mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mtd><mtd style="width: 50%"></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd style="width: 50%"></mtd><mtd style="text-align: right;justify-items: end;padding-right: 0;"></mtd><mtd style="text-align: left;justify-items: start;padding-left: 0;"><mo>=</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mrow><mo lspace="0.1667em">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd style="width: 50%"></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd style="width: 50%"></mtd><mtd style="text-align: right;justify-items: end;padding-right: 0;"></mtd><mtd style="text-align: left;justify-items: start;padding-left: 0;"><mo>=</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mtext>Pr</mtext><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mtd><mtd style="width: 50%"></mtd></mtr></mtable></math>
<p>This means <math><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo>⟂</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo>∣</mo><mi>C</mi></math>.</p>
